    "information": {
      "description": "<p><em>Compact Groundcar.</em> Upgrades: TUp (MetalGear Coating [+3 SP, -5 MOVE]) Armored Chassis, Autopilot Terminal, Bulletproof Glass [x2], Bulwark Armor [x3], Combat Plow, TUp (Self-Driving Vehicle) Communications Center, CrystalDome, Heavy Chassis, Hover Upgrade, Improved Engine, NOS [x4], Onboard Rocket Pod, Reinforced Tires, Sealed Environment, Vehicle Heavy Weapon Mount (w/ Mil-40L 20mm Recoilless Autocannon &amp; Remote Weapon System). Fills a 6×6m area, hovers 1m up and turns on a dime, ignoring small obstacles. Cargo hold for 1 ton. Autopilot at Skill Base 14. Everyone plugged in counts as both driver and passenger, so two crew give it two Actions and two Move Actions, mounts included.</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 121,000eb<br><strong>Nomad:</strong> 10<br><strong>SDP:</strong> 100<br><strong>SP:</strong> 22<br><strong>Seats:</strong> 2<br><strong>MOVE:</strong> 10<br><strong>Speed:</strong> 75 mph</p><p><small>Item Compendium (2070) • Vehicles</small></p>",
